ting at a sessiloid in the distance. 'No more [clickity] clacks!'\nYou say, 'I don't believe I can remove all of the light.'\nToobur ponders for a moment before continuing, 'Not all of light, some of light.' They point at an [ **elemental**] off in the distance and contort their face to look like it. 'Light walking, stop walking, be less light.'\nYou say, 'Necks?'\nToobur touches where their nose would be while pointing at you enthusiastically. 'Yes! Necks! Too many necks! Less necks! Too bitey, bitey me, bitey you! Bitey us. Stop [ **bitey**]?'\nYou say, 'I'll stop the bitey'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Such a Pain in the Neck'.\nToobur jumps up and punches the air in excitement in a motion that can only be described as 'Wahoo!'\n\n---\n\nToobur, a friendly spore creature you have found in the Deepshade, has communicated to you that they would want to have the crystal hydras destroyed. Specifically asking to remove the neck, but you know that's impossible without removing the rest of the hydra.\n1\\. Remove Necks! 0/10 Deepshade\nThese mobs count:\na crystal medusa [npc=58532]\na deepshade hydroid [npc=58533]\nReward:\n141 platinum 6 gold 6 silver 7 copper at Level 120\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
