      walkthrough = "**Status: Incomplete**\n\nQuest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Deepshade [zone=1305]\n**Who:**\n- Toobur [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 120\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a disgruntled stagehand [npc=58536]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Mercenary of Deepshade (10 Points) [quest=12242]\n**Era:** | !Night of Shadows\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Fri Nov 25 17:19:40 2022\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Night of Shadows Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\nYou can obtain this task from Toobur [npc=58564] in Darklight Caverns. You can find Toobur at /waypoint -1486, -62, 32 not far from the zone in. He is on the find tool as well CTRL F.\nYou say, 'Hail, Toobur'\nToobur looks curiously up at you as you speak. You do not see their mouth move, but you hear a child's voice form in your mind and say, 'H..hhhaail? Hail! Hail Hail! Hail!' You hear attempts to form other words as the voice seems to look for the right words to say. 'You...[help]?' The small mushroom looks around nervously. It is obvious that they are not used to dealing with your kind, but they are not aggressive toward your intrusion. You feel it would be best to help the little spore.\nYou say, 'Help with what?'\nToobur points to the nearest stream of glowing spores pouring from the ceiling and covers their eyes in a pantomime. 'Too...much...light? Yes! Much too much light. Less light! Light hurt eyes! [Remove] light!' Toobur continues miming, raising their hands in the air but not above their head, making a snarling face. 'Scary...necks? Too...much...[necks]. Less necks.' Toobur adds, 'Clickity Clacks?', while pointing at a sessiloid in the distance. 'No more [clickity] clacks!'\nYou say, 'I don't believe I can remove all of the light.'\nToobur ponders for a moment before continuing, 'Not all of light, some of light.' They point at an [elemental] off in the distance and contort their face to look like it. 'Light walking, stop walking, be less light.'\nYou say, 'Necks?'\nToobur touches where their nose would be while pointing at you enthusiastically. 'Yes! Necks! Too many necks! Less necks! Too bitey, bitey me, bitey you! Bitey us. Stop [bitey]?'\nYou say, 'No more clickity clacks?'\nToobur stomps on the ground furiously as the voice in your head grows with adorable rage, 'Clickity clacks hurt ears! Feel angry when they make noise. [Quiet] clickity clacks. Cannot think with noise!'\nYou say, 'Did you want me to get rid of some of the elementals?'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Lights Are Dimming!'.\n\n---\n\nThe Deepshade is home to many creatures. One of those creatures, Toobur, has asked that you help clean up the Deepshade by dispatching some of the elementals that roam in the caves.\n1\\. Kill Lights!\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n141pp 6g 6s 7cp at Level 120\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
